    "font" : "CMR12",
    "font size" : 11.955,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Thus, the order of ǫ in (OK/pOK)× is a divisor of δ(p + 1). We will base our proof of Theorem 1.4 on the following result of Roskam [Ros00]."
