      "font size" : 11.955,
      "text color" : "[0.0]",
      "content" : "Proposition 5.1 (conditional on GRH). There are inﬁnitely many primes p, inert in K, for which the order of ǫ in (OK/pOK)× is precisely δ(p + 1).",
