        "font" : "CMR12",
        "font size" : 11.955,
        "text color" : "[0.0]",
        "content" : "(In fact, Roskam shows that the order is δ(p+1) not only for inﬁnitely many inert primes, but for a positive proportion of all inert primes. The weaker version here is suﬃcient for our purposes.) Theorem 1.4 is an immediate consequence of Proposition 5.1 in conjunction with the next assertion."
