    "content" : "ǫ(p−1)ℓ(p) ≡ 1 (mod pOK). We are assuming that ǫ has order δ(p+1) in (OK/pOK)×. Hence, the displayed congruence forces p + 1 | δ(p + 1) | (p − 1)ℓ(p)."
